  {"id":18,"word":"Warm-up","category":"Sports & Fitness","subcategory":"Training & Exercise","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"વૉર્મ-અપ","english_meaning":"A period of gentle exercise done before more intense physical activity to prepare the body.","gujarati_meaning":"વધુ જોરદાર શારીરિક પ્રવૃત્તિ પહેલાં શરીરને તૈયાર કરવા હળવી કસરત.","synonyms":["preparation exercise","limbering up"],"antonyms":["cool-down"],"collocations":["warm-up routine","warm-up exercise","do a warm-up"],"word_forms":["warm up (verb)"],"usage_note":"Essential before any workout to prevent injury and improve performance.","memory_tip":"'Warm' = ગરમ + 'up' = ઉપર → warm-up = શરીર ગરમ કરવું.","examples":["Always do a warm-up before running.","The team warm-up lasted fifteen minutes.","A proper warm-up prevents muscle injuries.","She skipped her warm-up and pulled a muscle."]},
