  {"id":20,"word":"Interval Training","category":"Sports & Fitness","subcategory":"Training & Exercise","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Advanced","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"ઇન્ટર્વલ ટ્રેઇનિંગ","english_meaning":"A training method alternating between high-intensity bursts and rest or low-intensity periods.","gujarati_meaning":"ઊંચી તીવ્રતા અને ઓછી તીવ્રતા/આરામ — ક્રમ-ક્રમ ચાલુ-બંધ પ્રશિક્ષણ.","synonyms":["HIIT","interval workout"],"antonyms":["steady-state training"],"collocations":["interval training session","interval training program","high-intensity interval training"],"word_forms":[],"usage_note":"Also called HIIT. Very effective for fat loss and cardiovascular fitness.","memory_tip":"'Interval' = વિરામ → interval training = વિરામ-સહિત ઉચ્ચ-તીવ્ર અભ્યાસ.","examples":["Interval training burns more calories than steady jogging.","He followed an interval training schedule.","Interval training improves cardiovascular fitness rapidly.","The coach designed an interval training plan."]},
  {"id":21,"word":"Endurance","category":"Sports & Fitness","subcategory":"Training & Exercise","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"ઇન્ડ્યૂરન્સ","english_meaning":"The ability to sustain prolonged physical exertion over a long period.","gujarati_meaning":"લાંબા સમય સુધી શારીરિક પ્રયત્ન ટકાવી રાખવાની ક્ષમતા.","synonyms":["stamina","staying power","resilience"],"antonyms":["weakness","fatigue"],"collocations":["build endurance","endurance training","endurance athlete"],"word_forms":["endure (verb)","enduring (adj)"],"usage_note":"Key quality for long-distance runners, swimmers, and cyclists.","memory_tip":"'Endure' = સહન કરવું → endurance = સહનશક્તિ.","examples":["Marathon runners must build exceptional endurance.","Endurance training helps the heart work efficiently.","Her endurance in the race was remarkable.","He trains his endurance with long runs."]},
  {"id":22,"word":"Agility","category":"Sports & Fitness","subcategory":"Training & Exercise","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"એજિલિટી","english_meaning":"The ability to move quickly and easily, changing direction rapidly.","gujarati_meaning":"ઝડપથી અને સરળતાથી ફરવાની, ઝડપથી દિશા બદલવાની ક્ષમતા.","synonyms":["nimbleness","quickness","dexterity"],"antonyms":["sluggishness","clumsiness"],"collocations":["agility drills","agility training","agility ladder"],"word_forms":["agile (adj)","agilely (adv)"],"usage_note":"Important for football, basketball, and tennis players who need to change direction fast.","memory_tip":"'Agile' = ચપળ → agility = ચપળતા.","examples":["Agility drills helped him dodge defenders.","Football players need agility to be effective.","Her agility on the court was impressive.","Agility training involves ladder and cone drills."]},
  {"id":23,"word":"Flexibility","category":"Sports & Fitness","subcategory":"Training & Exercise","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"ફ્લૅક્સિબિલિટી","english_meaning":"The range of motion available in a joint or group of joints.","gujarati_meaning":"સાંધા અથવા સ્નાયુઓ કેટલી હદ સુધી વળી અને ખેંચી શકાય તે ક્ષમતા.","synonyms":["suppleness","limberness"],"antonyms":["stiffness","rigidity"],"collocations":["improve flexibility","flexibility training","flexibility exercises"],"word_forms":["flexible (adj)","flex (verb)"],"usage_note":"Yoga, stretching, and Pilates are common flexibility training methods.","memory_tip":"'Flex' = વાળવું → flexibility = વળવાની ક્ષમતા.","examples":["Yoga greatly improves flexibility.","Flexibility reduces the risk of muscle injuries.","She has remarkable flexibility for a sprinter.","Flexibility training should be done daily."]},
