  {"id":30,"word":"Circuit Training","category":"Sports & Fitness","subcategory":"Training & Exercise","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"સર્કિટ ટ્રેઇનિંગ","english_meaning":"A workout format with a series of exercises performed one after another with minimal rest.","gujarati_meaning":"ઘણી કસરતો ક્રમ-ક્રમ, ઓછા આરામ સાથે કરવાનો વ્યાયામ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ.","synonyms":["circuit workout","station training"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":["circuit training session","circuit training program","fitness circuit"],"word_forms":["circuit (noun)"],"usage_note":"Combines cardio and strength in one session. Time-efficient workout.","memory_tip":"'Circuit' = ˆ-ˆ-ˆ → circuit training = ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ.","examples":["Circuit training combines cardio and strength.","She completed three circuits in forty minutes.","Circuit training is efficient for busy people.","The gym offers morning circuit training classes."]},
