  {"id":32,"word":"Overtraining","category":"Sports & Fitness","subcategory":"Training & Exercise","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Advanced","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"ઓવર-ટ્રેઇનિંગ","english_meaning":"Excessive training that causes fatigue, decreased performance, and risk of injury.","gujarati_meaning":"અત્યધિક ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ, ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ.","synonyms":["overexertion","burnout"],"antonyms":["undertraining","recovery"],"collocations":["overtraining syndrome","avoid overtraining","overtraining symptoms"],"word_forms":["overtrain (verb)"],"usage_note":"Signs include constant fatigue, mood changes, and declining performance.","memory_tip":"'Over' = ˆ-ˆ-ˆ + 'training' = ˆ-ˆ-ˆ → overtraining = ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ.","examples":["Overtraining can lead to serious injury.","He showed symptoms of overtraining.","Avoid overtraining by scheduling rest days.","The coach warned against overtraining."]},
  {"id":33,"word":"Periodization","category":"Sports & Fitness","subcategory":"Training & Exercise","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Advanced","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"પિરિઓ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ","english_meaning":"A structured training plan that divides the season into phases to optimize performance.","gujarati_meaning":"ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ.","synonyms":["training cycles","phased training"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":["training periodization","periodization plan","periodization model"],"word_forms":["periodize (verb)"],"usage_note":"Involves macrocycles, mesocycles, and microcycles to peak at the right time.","memory_tip":"'Period' = ˆ-ˆ-ˆ → periodization = ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ-ˆ.","examples":["Periodization helps athletes peak at competitions.","The coach applied periodization to the training plan.","Periodization prevents burnout and overtraining.","Olympic athletes use periodization strategies."]},
